{"id":389,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为持续深化学风建设，严抓课堂教学管理，规范学生课堂出勤秩序，切实提高学生到课率、强化课堂学习实效，经济与管理学院学风监督组依托指纹识别智能设备，建立课后出勤常态化核查机制。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KnN7OsM4GPLznkoxzVVnzTVLmlPM4lJsoRC8oz98nzVkUmv0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8nkyZoSyZUl78UlLDLRG4M4nfMRQ7M8Uiol7inlLanmWFM8W2n7LPLNVFL8Q2LRGJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-8LmCbgtA8pU0cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24269&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E4D898AA4AC600374A46D7D59A5EC0F2/7BFDC12A/3FF00\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KnN7OsM4GPLznkoxzVVnzTVLmlPM4lJsoRC8oz98nzVkUmv0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8nkyZoSyZUl78UlLDLRG4M4nfMRQ7M8Uiol7inlLanmWFM8W2n7LPLNVFL8Q2LRGJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-8LmCbgtA8pU0cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24269&e=.png\"></p><p>本次智能查课覆盖全院大一至大三全部专业主干课程，采用随机抽查、无提前告知的突击督查模式开展，推动学院学风管理工作向智能化、精细化、精准化转型。经济与管理学院将持续以智能化工具赋能日常管理，刚性落实学风建设各项制度，全力营造勤学笃行、严谨创新的优良育人氛围，引导学生端正学习态度、珍惜课堂学习机会，在自我约束中锤炼品格，在勤学奋进中成长成才。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KM8UOsMzQkU4vZMxRA7n7M2M4rfolWJRUmNPLllbozN4MRl0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8U1h2okyiMNU8MlnknNlZn7CsMNLinz6VL8liMzNbo7QFUNQfnm7bL4AFL4viLmCJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-8LmCbgtA8pU0cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24269&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E4BF856D45DBFE8DF76C5E7E3E55998F/BFAF1938/37526\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KM8UOsMzQkU4vZMxRA7n7M2M4rfolWJRUmNPLllbozN4MRl0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8U1h2okyiMNU8MlnknNlZn7CsMNLinz6VL8liMzNbo7QFUNQfnm7bL4AFL4viLmCJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-8LmCbgtA8pU0cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24269&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KnN7OsM4GPLznkoxzVVnzTVLmlPM4lJsoRC8oz98nzVkUmv0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8nkyZoSyZUl78UlLDLRG4M4nfMRQ7M8Uiol7inlLanmWFM8W2n7LPLNVFL8Q2LRGJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-8LmCbgtA8pU0cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24269&e=.png"}